foopgp-hugowebsite (1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of the website deployment tooling: Apache vhost
    (sites-available/foopgp.conf, ServerAlias www.foopgp.org), a www-data cron
    that pulls from codeberg (github mirror configured) and rebuilds public/
    with hugo --minify when sources moved, bootstrapping the /var/www clone on
    first run, and a goaccess stats job publishing into public/goaccess/.
  * FHS layout: scripts in /usr/share, logs in /var/log/foopgp-hugowebsite.

